# 🏗️ Monorepo Implementation Plan
## Golang Backend + Python AI Service

---

## 📐 Tổng quan kiến trúc

```
Monorepo
├── Backend (Golang) — REST/gRPC API, business logic
└── AI Service (Python) — Model inference, AI pipeline
```

**Giao tiếp nội bộ**: HTTP REST hoặc gRPC giữa Go ↔ Python  
**Config**: Environment-based với Pydantic (Python) + Viper (Go)  
**Logging**: Structured JSON logging (zerolog cho Go, structlog/loguru cho Python)  
**Exception**: Custom error hierarchy (Go errors package + Python custom exceptions)

